  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNODC - Enhance Capacities of Criminal Justice Actors in Punjab</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is to support Police Service in Punjab Provin e of Pakistan to Enhance Capacities of Criminal Justice Actors in Punjab - Pakistan. The Project aims to combat the threat of modern day sophisticated and complex crime trends, enhance the standard of investigtion, intoduce specialised and upto date modules of advance technology in the police training institutions to handle intricacies of cyber crimes and catching the culprits within the shortest possible time.</narrative>
  </description>
